{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stretcherz-stretch-squad-assortment-and-slammerz-assortment-toys-2602-0156","content_id":"f95680e9-ff70-4f2e-9295-d7c77c77039c","description":"Product Recall for HTI Toys Stretcherz Toys presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e2b4d196-842c-46fa-9aca-0f89e474333e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-28T12:03:53+01:00","id":"e2b4d196-842c-46fa-9aca-0f89e474333e","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-28T12:03:53+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a18211959fb7a60f827f43d/2602-0156-product-recall-stretcherz-toys.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: HTI Toys Stretcherz Toys</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as the sand included in the set may be contaminated with a quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by HTI Toys (manufacturer) and the following distributors/retailers: ALDI, Argos, ASDA, B&amp;M, Card Factory, The Entertainer and Early Learning Centre (ELC), Home Bargains, Matalan, Morrisons, Poundland, Primark, Smyths Toys, Tesco, TK Maxx/Homesense, and The Works.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Action Figures (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Stretcherz</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Identifiers</td>\n      <td>For a full list of product identifiers and images, please see Annex A in the linked PDF.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Stretch toys filled with sand-like material.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Images</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e2b4d196-842c-46fa-9aca-0f89e474333e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a18211959fb7a60f827f43d/2602-0156-product-recall-stretcherz-toys.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by HTI Toys (manufacturer) and the following distributors/retailers: ALDI, Argos, ASDA, B&amp;M, Card Factory, The Entertainer and Early Learning Centre (ELC), Home Bargains, Matalan, Morrisons, Poundland, Primark, Smyths Toys, Tesco, TK Maxx/Homesense, and The Works. Additional distributors/retailers will be added to this list, and further instructions provided, as recalls are launched.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the product.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, please access the specific business websites below:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>HTI Toys: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.htigroup.co.uk/portfolio-item/recall-information/\">https://www.htigroup.co.uk/portfolio-item/recall-information/</a>\n</li>\n  <li>ALDI: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://help.aldi.co.uk/faqs/article/Product-Recall---Stretcherz-Twin-Pack-Skulls\">https://help.aldi.co.uk/faqs/article/Product-Recall—Stretcherz-Twin-Pack-Skulls</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Argos: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.argos.co.uk/events/safety-product-recalls\">https://www.argos.co.uk/events/safety-product-recalls</a>.</li>\n  <li>ASDA:<a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://corporate.asda.com/product-recalls\">https://corporate.asda.com/product-recalls</a>\n</li>\n  <li>B&amp;M: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.bmstores.co.uk/product-recalls\">https://www.bmstores.co.uk/product-recalls</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Card Factory: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.cardfactory.co.uk/product-recall.html\">https://www.cardfactory.co.uk/product-recall.html</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Early Learning Centre: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.elc.co.uk/product-safety-notices\">https://www.elc.co.uk/product-safety-notices</a>\n</li>\n  <li>The Entertainer: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.thetoyshop.com/medias/stretcherz-product-safety-notice.pdf?context=bWFzdGVyfHJvb3R8Mjk5MjQyfGFwcGxpY2F0aW9uL3BkZnxhRGxpTDJobE1pOHhNamN3T0RNMk1EVXhPVGN4TUM5emRISmxkR05vWlhKNkxYQnliMlIxWTNRdGMyRm1aWFI1TFc1dmRHbGpaUzV3WkdZfDUxYThiODllZTNmYzFjMTUyYmJmOTRiYTkyZGRjOWMyMDRjNjQ3YmEyNmY5OGM3YzZkNjllMGM0NzZkNDlmMTU\">https://www.thetoyshop.com/product-safety-notices</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Home Bargains: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://help.homebargains.co.uk/hc/en-gb/sections/16908022989201-Product-Recalls\">https://help.homebargains.co.uk/productrecall</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Matalan: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.matalan.co.uk/c/customer-services/product-recall-notice/\">https://www.matalan.co.uk/c/customer-services/product-recall-notice/</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Morrisons: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://my.morrisons.com/product-recall/\">https://my.morrisons.com/product-recall/</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Poundland: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.poundland.co.uk/product-recall\">https://www.poundland.co.uk/product-recall</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Primark: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.primark.com/help/s/article/Product-Safety-Recall-Notice---Stretcherz?language=ean_GB\">https://www.primark.com/help/s/article/Stretcherz</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Smyth’s Toys: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.smythstoys.com/uk/en-gb/product-information\">https://www.smythstoys.com/uk/en-gb/product-information</a>.</li>\n  <li>Tesco: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tesco.com/zones/product-recall?srsltid=AfmBOor-Zni21RPJvVFyZOMQLaKNW5vX_nn-yHaOVQjjCmjdjxVX1baj\">https://www.tesco.com/zones/product-recall</a>\n</li>\n  <li>TKMaxx: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall</a> and Homesense: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.homesense.com/product-recalls\">https://www.homesense.com/product-recalls</a>\n</li>\n  <li>The Works <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.theworks.co.uk/page/product-recalls.html?srsltid=AfmBOopSjqgkT9CEKjmYt22CTJan3M8JxcqOTUMeohs6qD2mK8lFAm7R\">https://www.theworks.co.uk/page/product-recalls</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions--all\">Disposal instructions – All</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.  </li>\n  <li>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.  </li>\n  <li>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.   </li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.  </li>\n  <li>Return the product to store where specified by the retailer for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to the retailer, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact the retailer or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">OPSS page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2602-0156</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Recall scope expanded - Card Factory","public_timestamp":"2026-05-01T13:39:51Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded - Matalan","public_timestamp":"2026-03-24T15:58:40Z"},{"note":"Additional distributors/retailers added to this list.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-04T11:02:57Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-03T13:45:19Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-26T16:31:52Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-24T10:50:23Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-23T13:31:17Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:50:30Z"},{"note":"Recall scope expanded. ","public_timestamp":"2026-02-20T12:31:23Z"},{"note":"Manufacturer is now undertaking a recall. ","public_timestamp":"2026-02-18T14:22:59Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-17T17:37:34Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions--all","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions – All"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-17","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-17T17:37:34+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stretcherz-stretch-squad-assortment-and-